  "date": "2026-11-12T20:21:02Z",
  "subject": "fix(metal1): drop the custom audience from the Vault login token (#2030)",
  "body": "Vault calls metal1's TokenReview API with the login token itself; a token with\naudience 'vault' is rejected there (401), so Vault answered 403. The role now checks\nthe default audience https://kubernetes.default.svc instead.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n"
}
